{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50664","headline":"题小华山（原注：「目黄山爲小华」。） · 李敬方","name":"题小华山（原注：「目黄山爲小华」。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峰簇莲花小，分明似华山。\n鱼符何日罢，深处掩松关。\n（见闵麟嗣撰《黄山志定本》卷六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李敬方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}